WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.851
Good listeners attend to the complete message and take brief notes before answering.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:11.915
“Ama sorted paper and plastic into separate bins.” What is the main idea? Answer: Ama

00:00:11.915 --> 00:00:13.572
separated waste for recycling.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:19.058
Listen to a partner's one-minute announcement and record the place, time and purpose.

00:00:19.867 --> 00:00:22.704
Discuss why: The central action is sorting waste.
